      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i had a weird thing happen just now. i stood up to grab something and everything just went black for a few seconds. i felt really lightheaded and then i was just... out. probably just dehydrated since it's been hot, right? should i just drink some extra water and lie down? i dont really wanna deal with a doctor visit if it's nothing.",
